@jjunho/dsh-peer2peer README · dsh-peer2peer：Peer-to-peer messaging between DeepSeek Harness **sessions** — a native DSH
take on the Pi `coms` extension.

> npm package: `@jjunho/dsh-peer2peer`

@jjunho/dsh-peer2peer README · Configuration：`peer_configure` overrides these per session, so two windows in one process can
have distinct names (`frontend` / `backend`) — something a single process-wide
env var cannot express.
